window.products.push({"id":170053,"name":"Yorktown L Shaped Desk with Hutch, Lateral File Cabinet and Bookcase","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1408.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jPZRgtGNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Bush Furniture Yorktown L Shaped Desk with Hutch, Lateral File Cabinet and Bookcase in Antique Cherry, you can create the perfect office that coordinates with your existing home design. Expansive Desk surface has plenty of room for a computer, printer and more with extra space to spread out comfortably. Open storage compartment below holds a laptop or tablet when not in use. Box drawer stores supplies, and file drawer extends fully on ball-bearing slides for easy access to letter-sized papers to keep work area clean and organized. Hutch features two closed storage compartments to conceal papers and binders with self-closing Euro-style hinges for a soft close. Flexible open storage cubbies in the middle have two adjustable shelves so you can put memorabilia and binders where you want them. Two Lateral File Cabinet drawers accommodate letter and legal-sized files so you can keep important papers concealed, yet organized. Bookcase comes with two fixed shelves for stability and three adjustable shelves so you can display books, collectables, and artwork where you want them most. With a weathered Antique Cherry finish accented by oil-rubbed Bronze hardware and beveled edge detailing, Yorktown makes an attractive addition to your home furnishings. Backed by the Bush Furniture 1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty, the collection meets ANSI/SOHO quality test standards for performance and safety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jPZRgtGNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B07F2V687V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F2V687V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F2V687V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
