window.products.push({"id":170236,"name":"BOSKA Professional Series Cheese Wires, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qjUyf1YbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"At Boska Holland we've been crazy about cheese for over 100 years. It all started near Gouda, home of the original Gouda cheeses, where Willem Boz made his first cheese tools for local cheese farmers. From that day it's our family tradition to inspire you on your journey through the delicious cheeses of the world. Explore cheese and enjoy it. Boska represents beautiful, smart products for cheese. Boska Holland Professional tools provide solutions for the grating, cutting and packaging of cheese in a safer, more hygienic environment for your business. The Boska stainless steel cutting wire with 2 plastic grips works with semi-hard and hard cheeses. It cuts cheese with clean lines and very little mess. The 47.2 inch long stainless steel wire is replaceable and the drawing wire and grips are dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qjUyf1YbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSKA","source_asin":"B00BCU408U","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BCU408U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BCU408U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
