window.products.push({"id":170244,"name":"Fieemoo Fruit and Vegetable Washing Machine, Portable Food Purifier, Ultrasonic Washing Cleaner, USB Rechargeable & Magnetic Charging for Home Indoor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nUlraHQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Healthy & Secure : Our food purifier adopts high-energy ultrasonic cleaning technology, releases OH-Ions when in water and degrade quickly harmful substances such as bacteria, pesticide residues and hormone from the food you eat every day (meat, fruits, veggie, etc.). Simple & Convenient : the portable fruit and vegetable cleaner is easy to operate. Press the power button, place the machine into the water and leave it for 10 minutes to finish cleaning. It saves you time to clean food before eating or cooking. Compact & Portable : Similar in size to a palm, and works without a cable connection, it can be carried everywhere. The battery capacity is enough to support more than 10 uses, which is convenient for traveling on business trip, camping in the RV, or outdoor travel. Wireless & Rechargeable : The cleaning device is equipped built-in 2000mAh battery and charged by USB magnetic absorption. It can be used about 50 times after about 5 hours of full charging (The default is 10 minutes each time). Multifunction Application : 5V Direct contact without strong electricity, IPX7 waterproof, our vegetable and fruit washing machine is safe and stable and has long service life, widely used for cleaning food, meat, seafood and also tableware,kitchen utensils.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nUlraHQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fieemoo","source_asin":"B0BS1595ZH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS1595ZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS1595ZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":170245,"name":"Replacement Designed To Fit Hoover 303903001 & 303902001 WindTunnel Air Bagless Upright Filter Kit, Fits UH70400 & UH70405 Models","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+hmCefbL._AC_SL1087_.jpg","description":"This is a convenient filter kit put together for you to save you time, and money. Included with this kit is both filters used on the Hoover WindTunnel Air Bagless Upright models UH70400 and UH70405. The Primary Washable Pre-Motor Filter is located directly underneath of the Dust Bin lid, and should be washed at least once every 30 days to ensure peak performance. The washable primary filter is designed to fit Hoover Part Number 303903001. Also included is the Post Exhaust HEPA Filter Cartridge, Designed to fit Hoover Part Number 303902001. This filter is located directly under where the dirt cup attaches to the vacuum, and is accessed by pressing the release cover to open and expose the HEPA Pleated Filter. This filter should be changed once every 6-12 months, average homes every 12 months, and homes with allergy sufferers, or children with Asthma, or homes with pets which vacuum more frequently, once every 6 months. Replacement aftermarket filters. Save BIG When Buying These Two Filters for the Hoover WindTunnel Air UH70400 & UH70405 Bagless Upright Vacuum Cleaners! Filter Kit includes Both Primary Washable Sponge Type Filter, and The Post Exhaust HEPA Filter. Aftermarket filters not made by Hoover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+hmCefbL._AC_SL1087_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Replacement","source_asin":"B008VOH8UM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008VOH8UM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008VOH8UM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":170246,"name":"CorningWare Glass-Ceramic Pyroceram Round Classic Casserole, 2.4 Quart / 2.25 Liter Cooking Pot with Handles & Glass Cover - White (Medium)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+QSbULSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CorninWare was established over half a century ago. It was first introduced in the United Sates in 1958. The discovery was made in 1953, by S. Donald Stookey who accidentally discovered Pyroceram, a white glass-ceramic while working with photosensitive glass. The material is able to withstand sudden temperature change of up to 840 degree Fahrenheit. Because of its heat-resistant property, Pyroceram has been used widely for different functions such as fireplaces, wood burning stoves, oven, broilers, and was even used in the ballistic missile program for nose cones. The Pyroceram material is far superior than most other types of ceramic. Uniquely versatile and extremely resilient to temperature changes. It can be taken from the refrigerator or freezer and used directly on the stovetop, in an oven, microwave, or under a broiler, without risk of thermal shock, cracking, or explosion. Corningware Classic is the one dish that does it all. Uniquely versatile and extremely resilient to temperature changes, it can be put on the stove, in the microwave or the oven the minute it's out of the fridge, saving you time and effort. This durable break and chip resistant glass cookware/bakeware is also stylish enough to use as a serving dish on your table. Amazingly versatile: use on stovetop, oven, broiler (without cover), refrigerator, freezer, or microwave. Easy to clean; dishwasher safe Offers real convenience and versatility unmatched by conventional cookware. The non-porous glass-ceramic won't absorb food odors or flavors or react with acid-based foods. Corningware Classic cookware provides unequaled convenience and versatility as it can be used to cook in the oven or stovetop and then presented directly on your dining table all in one dish. Corningware Classic cookware is also the ideal casserole dish because it retains heat much longer. This means that you can use a much lower heat setting on the stovetop and cooking will continue even after the gas has been turned off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+QSbULSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CorningWare","source_asin":"B08WHYK1P2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WHYK1P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WHYK1P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
