window.products.push({"id":170303,"name":"LIVEBOX Boho Shower Curtain, 72x78 Inches Black and White Fabric Tassel Triangle Stripes Geometric Shower Curtain Set with Hooks Tribal Bathroom Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mRmThHN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIVEBOX Shower Curtain Set Black and White Shower Curtain Bohemian Geometric Design with Tassels shower curtains for bathroomWhat size should a shower curtain be for a bathroom?The first thing to keep in mind is how and where you want to attach them. Most shower curtains come in a standard 72-inch length and are between 70-72 inches wide. If you have a walk-in unit, you'll want a curtain that's about 78 inches long. For a standing shower, the curtains need to be long enough to reach the floor. If you need curtains for the bathtub, however, you probably want shorter curtains.What material should a bathroom shower curtain to choose?If you want to throw your shower curtain into the washing machine, your best bet is to look for one made from a durable polyester fabric material, though any non-fabric curtains can still be wiped down with a cloth. On top of that, a hookless shower curtain (with reinforced metal grommets) can make it much less of a chore to remove the curtain from its rod and eliminates the need for you to buy separate hooks.Product Features:Color: black and whiteMaterial：100% soft polyesterTechnique: printed technologyPattern: triangle and strips geometricSize: 36x72 inch, 60x72 inch, 72x72 inch,72x75 inch or 72x78 inchPackage Included: 1 boho shower curtain and 12 plastic hooksAffordable & Elegant: These tassels designs add elegantly mysterious elements while fitting almost of your budgets!Satisfaction Guarantee:If you are not satisfied with tribal shower curtain, plz feel free to contact us. We stand by our area rugs 100% and want all of our customers to love them as much as we do!Cleaning Instructions:machine wash in cold water with mild detergent, color will not fade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mRmThHN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIVEBOX","source_asin":"B08CZMVHT5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZMVHT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZMVHT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
