window.products.push({"id":170325,"name":"Ceramic Honing Rod, Knife Sharpener Rod with 2 Grit Options, Kitchen, Home & Chef Sharpening Rod Stick,Firm-Grip Handle (8IN)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I5OvgShfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you like cooking,have you tried ceramic sharpeners before? If you want to try something new,why not start from a new ceramic hone? Our ceramic honing rod will not let you down! Feature: High-Quality Ceramic Honing Rod Our ceramic honing is made of high-quality ceramic materials, which is durable and suitable for sharpening all kinds of knives. Belive that it will be your best choice! Two Grit Options: 1.1000 grits with two sides--- the lined/stropped side for particularly dull knives, the  smooth side for the edge polish, or both for progressive knife sharpening. Available in 8 inches. 2.2000 grits with pure sharpening surface,give your knives a finer sharpening effect. 10 and 12 inches are suitable. Trustworthy Knife Sharpener Rod There is no plastic or rubber tip on the end of the ceramic sharpener, which prevents accidental damage or shredding of the knife during honing. Careful Service: If you have any problem, please contact us first, we will offer you a satisfied solution immediately. Your 100% satisfaction is very important to us! How To Use: 1. Hold the ceramic rod vertically, and place its tip on a towel or other non-slip surface. If you are not sure about the sharpness of the knife, first place the root of the knife against the rod with a certain angle. 2. Starting from the root, slowly move the knife to the top. When moving the elbow back, keep your wrist still and apply a little pressure on the rod. Note: Keep the same angle throughout the honing process. Note: 1. Keep the ceramic sharpener rod stable when sharpening 2. Avoid falling from high places Products Include: 1* ceramic sharpener rod","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I5OvgShfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEKEAN","source_asin":"B08VJDX8GF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJDX8GF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJDX8GF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
