window.products.push({"id":170379,"name":"Large Wall Clock – 24”~ Roman Numeral Wall Clocks ~ Our Silent Metal Oversized Wall Clocks Enhance The Decor in A Living Room – Extra’s: 4 Sets of Han","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZtRBnlkAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Timeless Style In Bold Wrought Iron: Is there anything more elegant than classic black wrought iron wall décor? Your kitchen, living room, foyer, den, bedroom, or indoor patio gets an upgrade when you adorn the space with this oversized vintage analog clock. Its reliable functionality helps you plan your schedule while its charming style keeps you smiling. Handsome Roman numerals grace the circular form in your choice of sizes: 24 inches or 30 inches. Try Your Hand At A Subtle Detail Change: Want a slight adjustment to your beautiful statement piece? Why not switch out the clock hands once in a while. We made it easy and fun—every modern clock comes with four (4) interchangeable hands in lovely metallic options: black, silver, gold, & brass. Whichever stunning finish strikes your mood, rest assured the hands move with silent dexterity to ensure accurate time every minute of the day. Enjoy A Fast Room Upgrade With Simple Installation: It may look like a weighty antique but you’ll be delighted to discover how easy it is to get your industrial wall clock both set up and hung up. Its top-quality silent quartz movement runs on one (1) AA battery and the easy-to-handle frame is equipped with sturdy rear hooks for a truly easy installation. You’ll love how it instantly enhances the room with pure sophistication. Blends In Effortlessly With Any Interior Design: Whether you have a farmhouse style kitchen, a modern dining room, a boho bedroom, or a minimalist office this chameleon of a clock fits in anywhere. Clean, traditional black metal Roman numerals cushioned between two sleek circles convey a polished, timeless effect that looks amazing in every atmosphere, from country chic to glossy high-tech. What a clever way to accessorize your favorite space. Trust A Hard-Working American Business: The JA Global Express duo, James and Andrea, are passionate about their American-made business—offering you the very best in interior design products with exceptional flair & superior craftsmanship. They believe in giving back to underserved communities in the U.S. & Brazil, so you can feel great knowing a portion of every purchase goes directly to deserving organizations!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZtRBnlkAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JA Global Express ORDEM E PROGRESSO","source_asin":"B09CFTXYQH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170379","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CFTXYQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CFTXYQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
