window.products.push({"id":170579,"name":"BB BLINBLIN Soft and Breathable Duvet Cover for Weighted Blankets (80''x87'') for Two People- Brown Print…","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VjKBmGLeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A blanket that feels like a warm, comforting hugFor any kiddos and adults who get restless at night, our weighted blanket can help them fall asleep better or just relax and wind down after a long, hard day full of studying, playing and adventures. It puts just the right amount of pressure on the body that mimics the feeling of being hugged, held, or swaddled. The cuddle-like, relaxing pressure creates a sense of calmness, promotes a feeling of security to ease restlessness and encourages relaxation during sleep. Let you snuggle in it to feel the warmth on the couch, in the bed, or anywhere.Features:- Seven-layer construction: BB weighted blanket utilizes a seven-layer structure with glass beads locked in a gridded stitching to keep everything in place. - No piling or bunching: Quilted patterns with small 4.7\" x 4.7\" compartments ensure that the beads stay concentrated in their compartments and do not shift around at night. - Anti-leak stitching: The seams and pockets are tightly sealed to prevent beads from leaking out.- Premium microfiber made: The outer shell of our heavy duty weighted blanket is made of premium quality microfiber fabric for exceptional softness and comfort. - Convenient ties for duvet: Features eight ties on each end to keep this weighted blanket strapped to a duvet cover. - Perfect for hot sleepers: Our seven-layer premium weighted blanket keeps you cool and relaxing during those hot nights.Benefits of seven-layer construction:- Weight never feels unevenly distributed.- Provides padding against noise when you move around.- Perfect for hot regions.Weight and size guidelinesLook at our weighted blanket weight chart to find your size. We recommend selecting a weight around 10-14% of your body weight. For assistance, please consult the table.Wash care:Hand wash. Machine wash. Flat dry. Tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VjKBmGLeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BB BLINBLIN","source_asin":"B093GVPPG6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GVPPG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GVPPG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
