window.products.push({"id":170663,"name":"VCNY Home Quilt Set Nina Collection, Full/Queen, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rjXs0+jsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform your bedroom into a soothing sanctuary with this quilt set. Supremely soft, durable, and easy to wash, this stunning set comes in a variety of muted colors to suit your style. Enjoy of the warm comfort and soft, textured feel of this elegant quilt, which doubles as a bedspread or cozy throw blanket. King set includes quilt and two standard shams. Queen set includes quilt and two standard shams.Twin set includes quilt and one standard sham. Dimensions: King (104 inches x 90 inches) Full/Queen (90 inches x 90 inches) Twin (66 inches x 86 inches)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rjXs0+jsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VCNY Home","source_asin":"B0C418K3CF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C418K3CF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C418K3CF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":170664,"name":"Kegco KC 2KHBBLK Kegerator Kit, Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LE0jeS64L._AC_.jpg","description":"PRO SERIES DUAL GAUGE REGULATOR: Easily measure PSI and CO2 volume and adjust CO2 output pressure using this Kegco 542-2 Pro Series Double Gauge CO2 Regulator packed with premium features! The top gauge indicates output pressure, while the side gauge tells you what's left in the CO2 tank, so you don't run out of gas during a party. The chrome plated brass body has a large pressure adjustment knob for easy use and includes a manual pressure release valve. TWO COMPLETE SETS OF BALL LOCK HOME BREW KEG TAPS: These complete ball lock home brew keg tap sets include both a gas in and beer out coupler for easy tapping of ball lock Cornelius Pepsi kegs. The gas in comes with a 1/4\" nut and 5/16\" hose barb already attached, allowing you to quickly connect it to the same size air line that standard draft beer regulators use. The beer out connectors have a 3/16\" hose barb that connects to standard 3/16\" beer line. NEW 5 GALLON BALL LOCK HOMEBREW KEGS: This set of two Kegco 5 Gallon Home Brew Beer Kegs are constructed of 304 grade stainless steel and are designed for use with ball lock keg couplers. These homebrew kegs, also known as Pepsi kegs or Cornelius kegs, have permanently molded rubber bottom skirts and stainless steel strap handles for easy carrying. The stainless steel lids fasten tightly to the body and feature a pressure release valve to easily depressurize the keg. TWO CHROME BEER FAUCETS WITH BRASS LEVERS: Featuring forged brass bodies and highly polished chrome finishes, these NSF-approved Kegco CFBL beer faucets put a stylish finishing touch on your kegerator. The brass shaft assemblies and levers include non-stick ball washers for smooth operation, and the levers have standard threading that is compatible with most branded tap handles. These beer faucets come complete with two durable ABS plastic faucet knobs with a glossy black finish. INCLUDES A HEAVY DUTY FAUCET WRENCH: Make repairs and adjustments to your draft beer system like a pro using this heavy-duty faucet wrench. The durable metal wrench has a vinyl coated red or blue handle that provides an easy grip while loosening or tightening shank collars, allowing you to quickly attach or remove your faucets without scratching them","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LE0jeS64L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kegco","source_asin":"B00BXB3EBM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BXB3EBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BXB3EBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
