window.products.push({"id":170668,"name":"T-fal 5327100A Avante Deluxe Chrome Accents 4-Slice Toaster","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HMWEEMSQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The innovative and angled design on this four-slice T-Fal chrome toaster has a streamlined wedge shape that makes for easier removal of your toast. The control panel includes three functions: its cancel function raises toast in mid-cycle; the reheat function warms previously toasted bread; the defrost function is great for toasting frozen bread. The toasting grids have an automatic self-centering mechanism to center the bread for even and consistent toasting. It comes with a back handle for easy carrying and has a cord storage feature and 950 watts for high power. The toaster comes with a one-year limited warranty. Amazon.com Here's a thoroughly modern toaster large enough and nimble enough to serve the whole family. Extra-wide slots accommodate bagels, muffins, waffles, pastries, and thick bread. The four slots are divided into two independently operated sets, with each set of two slots having its own six-stop browning control for precise toasting. Each set also has a stop/eject button. In addition, the left set has buttons to defrost frozen bread and other items and to reheat previously toasted items that have gone cold. Each set also has a \"high-lift\" lever, to facilitate safe removal of small items, and its own removable crumb tray. The sizable toaster is lightweight and easily carried by its inset handle in the back. The handsome exterior of tough, white plastic wipes cleans with a cloth. --Fred Brack Editor's Choice: T-Fal's Avante Deluxe 4-slice toaster is our choice for the best toaster under $75. An attractive machine, this toaster may make other kitchen appliances jealous with the attention it will receive. But don't get stuck just on its looks, because it also has a variety of fine features.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HMWEEMSQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-fal","source_asin":"B00004SDTD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SDTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SDTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
