window.products.push({"id":170723,"name":"TOPOKO Vegetable Steamer Basket, Fits Instant Pot Pressure Cooker 5/6 QT and 8 QT, 18/8 Stainless Steel, Folding Steamer Insert For Veggie Fish Seafoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ro3lUU4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect combination Stainless steel metal basket comes complete as a steamer and strainer. Already assembled one piece combination. Collapsible - It goes from small to large 9” in a snap when petals are opened and comes with a convenient handle inside. Easy to Use - Frozen bags: single or mixed vegetables. - Raw: Corn, broccoli, cauliflower, or carrots - Try fish: cod, salmon, talapia, etc. Easy lift with 2” handle and o-ring to strain excess water and non-extendable to avoid spring malfunctioning injuries Have you been searching, how to use a vegetable steamer or vegetable steamer instructions ? If so, I have a few tips that will help you use the TOPOKO steamer. 1st - Wash before use! 2nd - Open the steamer and place raw or frozen vegetables inside. 3rd - Close the steamer and place in a pan or pot with just enough water to fill to where the base of the steamer is above the water level. 4th - Cover for a few minutes, timing is dependent on what you’re cooking, how much, and frozen or raw. Raw thin vegetables will definitely cook faster. Use a fork to check for tenderness. 5th - Use handle to lift and strain excess water while removing, season, and enjoy. Make sure you don’t boil dry. You can listen for when the water has evaporated. If you’re making baby food, you would transition your soft vegetables to some type of blender, where they could be quickly mashed for baby food. You can also manually mash them since they will be soft and tender. Clean up is a breeze. Although dishwasher safe, to preserve the quality of the steamer, it is best to hand wash and air or towel dry before storage. The compact design allows for easy storage without taking up tons of space. Gift Perfect wedding present, showers, housewarming, or a cook enthusiast. Buy Now or Add to Registry","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ro3lUU4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPOKO","source_asin":"B016AZJGI0","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016AZJGI0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016AZJGI0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
