window.products.push({"id":170736,"name":"French Bull 8-inch Melamine Flexible Nonstick Serving Spatula Turner for Cooking, Baking, Mixing, Pancake, Cake, Pie, Dishwasher Safe, One Size, Viva","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516tbqjSx5L._AC_SL1139_.jpg","description":"Product Description Vivify your stylish self while serving your baked goods up easy. From brownies to baklava our proprietary small spatula was designed with a beveled edge that cuts into soft foods smoothly, with a rounded handle that fits comfortably in your hand. Perfectly sized for cutting and serving yummy brownies, lasagna, or any other type of food that needs a small spatula. This spatula has a beveled edge that cuts into soft food. French Bull's high-grade glazed melamine spatula is great for the home or as a gift. This scratch and shatter resistant 8.5\" spatula is easy to clean since it's dishwasher safe, and heat resistant to 356-degree F, 180-degree C. Melamine is resistant to high heat, it's shatterproof, and an ideal ground for pattern. Plus, melamine is food safe and does not easily absorb fluids from food, which helps you avoid contaminating your food with harmful bacteria - a leading cause of illness and food poisoning. The durability and functionality of the material is perfect for indoor or outdoor entertaining. French Bull - reinterpreting everyday staples with a fresh, modern spin. From the Manufacturer Founded by Jackie Shapiro in 2002, French Bull is an inspired brand that elevates the ordinary to the extraordinary. French Bull's mastery of pattern and color has enhanced a wide variety of everyday products. From the home to the street, French Bull's iconic look and signature designs offer a sense of individualism, excitement, and pop. Always in motion, French Bull continues to expand into new product categories and grow its international presence. Celebrating \"the everyday,\" French Bull is a colorful reminder to always Live VIVID!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516tbqjSx5L._AC_SL1139_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"French Bull","source_asin":"B079YBWKV4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079YBWKV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079YBWKV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
