window.products.push({"id":170941,"name":"3-Piece Measuring Cups Set - Plastic Measuring Cups for Liquids - Spout, Handle Grip, Ml and Oz Measurement, BPA-free - 1 Cup, 2 Cup and 4 Cup - 250ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VfsRJQ8AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLASTIC MEASURING CUP SET - This versatile set of 3 consist of 1-cup, 2-cup and 4-cup plastic measuring cups for liquids to accommodate your daily pouring and measuring needs. Our heavy-duty ml measuring cups can hold a variety of contents ensuring that you’ll always know exactly how much of an ingredient you’re using. Perfect for experienced Chefs or beginners, who love DIY food, baking, and cooking. BPA FREE PREMIUM MATERIAL - These measuring cups plastic is highly durable, non-toxic, and BPA-free plastic which makes it safe to use with direct food contact in your cooking and baking applications. ACCURATE & CONVENIENT MEASURING: Our measuring cup helps make your time-consuming tasks easier and reduces waste of time with accurate and easy-to-read measurement markings on the cups. This soap making measuring cups are labelled with cup and ounce measurement on one side and metric scale in millilitre on the other. The red color printed markings over the clear plastic material make them highly visible and see content through for easy and convenient measuring. ERGONOMIC DESIGN - Our liquid measuring cups are designed to simplify your cooking/ baking with their practical and functional design. Lightweight measuring cup with spout and angled handle make the pouring and measuring fully loaded cups effortless. Moreover, its flat and wide bottom design limits tipping and spill, keeping your kitchen space mess-free. They can also be stacked for easy-storage. BEST FOR BAKING & COOKING - Thick, durable, and lightweight measuring pitcher cups are perfect for mixing and measuring your ingredients during cooking and baking. More than just for cooking, use these large measuring cups for a home party to make the perfect drink or professional use in the bakery, restaurant, café to make various foods like cream, sauce, pudding, cake batter, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VfsRJQ8AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AppleTofu","source_asin":"B08Z8GPD53","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-170941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z8GPD53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z8GPD53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
